Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.12,0:00:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What was your team hoping\Nto find here in Pompeii?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.86,0:00:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never tell a scum like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.70,0:00:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so. What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're still your two friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.68,0:00:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure one of them could be\Npersuaded into spilling their guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Which makes you WORTHLESS!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Those footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's running around\Noutside the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well now, would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be your friends dumped you in favor\Nof pursuing their precious secret item?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The trail of sound is heading\Ntowards the Kaveh Kanam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.70,0:00:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no question.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.46,0:00:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Killing you isn't worth the\Neffort it'd take to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.46,0:00:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll go snatch whatever\Nit is you're so keen on finding!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.96,0:00:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.87,0:00:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Abakio! Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.86,0:01:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.26,0:01:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the key?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.58,0:01:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha, gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.64,0:01:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.76,0:01:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.67,0:01:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not from around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that you got there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.34,0:01:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A key?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.32,0:01:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavens me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.42,0:01:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be like taking\Ncandy from a washed-up baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.70,0:01:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.61,0:01:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.53,0:01:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Try as you might, you can't unsee me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.72,0:01:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The die has been cast\Nand your fate is sealed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.84,0:02:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.10,0:03:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.66,0:03:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,next
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.92,0:03:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit, not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.34,0:03:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to understand how this\NKatsune messes with people's heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.56,0:03:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's hiding inside the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.90,0:03:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And logically speaking, that\Ncan only mean one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.12,0:03:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That reflective reject must have\Ndragged Fugo into a mirror world,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.68,0:03:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,effectively separating him from his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.84,0:03:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a shame, but the key comes first!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.10,0:03:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your breaking the mirror just\Nmade my job that much easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.76,0:03:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Reflections act as portals\Nto the mirror world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.58,0:03:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,By breaking it into pieces, you practically\Nhanded me your life on a silver platter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.40,0:03:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall grant you exclusive access to\Nmy world, but only your physical self.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.96,0:04:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be stuck in here for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.22,0:04:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, I'll be taking that key.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.00,0:04:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.64,0:04:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You can only do this with\Nthe power of a stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.74,0:04:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I dragged you in here alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.06,0:04:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can\Nbe choking Mirror Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.18,0:04:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess breaking that mirror\Nwasn't such a mistake after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.28,0:04:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your view of the outside world\Njust got a whole lot narrower.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You did drag something in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Problem is, you can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.88,0:04:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave me access.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.74,0:04:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But just for my physical self?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.00,0:04:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.64,0:04:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for making my job easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.74,0:04:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Moody Jazz!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.92,0:04:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I pulled in his stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.62,0:04:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside the mirror,\Neverything is ass backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.74,0:05:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost impossible to\Nfigure out that trick until
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.92,0:05:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,the bastard decides to\Nattack you with his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.26,0:05:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fugo must be somewhere in here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.94,0:05:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But how the hell do we\Nget out of this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.64,0:05:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If I have to massacre your\Nass to escape, then so be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.84,0:05:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to get a first-hand look at
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.80,0:05:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,why I sent Moody Jazz\Ninto your mirror prison!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.52,0:05:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So your power is an anthropomorphic\Nshape-shifting stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Stronto. You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.94,0:05:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, when all is said and done, your\Nwimpy little stand is pretty damn feeble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.68,0:05:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're screwed unless you're\Nfighting a total weakling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.78,0:05:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, come on, let's get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.50,0:05:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, didn't I already tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're as good as dead,\Nmy long-haired friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.70,0:06:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You managed to startle me slightly\Nwhen you showed up with a stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're still a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.02,0:06:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it occur to you that\NI'm crouching for a reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.98,0:06:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing it because I\Nhave no other choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.78,0:06:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.69,0:06:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hunched over to give my\Nfoot a clear path to your gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.68,0:06:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I was crouching so I\Ncould pick up this shard of mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.56,0:06:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's with the bewildered face?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.92,0:06:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this arm scare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.16,0:06:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you of all people\Nwould recognize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.30,0:06:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you from the beginning, reflections\Nserve as portals to another world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.28,0:06:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,By using a piece of glass to capture your\Nreflection, I created another portal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.40,0:06:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.64,0:06:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I dragged something special\Ninto this mirror world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your stinking arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.36,0:06:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't want you to get too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.02,0:06:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So only half your body was\Nallowed into this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.86,0:06:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,As for your stand here, I'll be\Nnice and let half of it leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.12,0:06:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you and your stand\Nexactly where I want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.86,0:07:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That key is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.04,0:07:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.95,0:07:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,All that work and there goes the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That means not only did\NI botch the mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.60,0:07:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but everything Giorno predicted\Nis about to come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.62,0:07:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.70,0:07:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.90,0:07:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Finding Fugo and taking this guy down will\Nbe our best shot at solving this mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.98,0:07:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I might be down right now, but\NI still have my pride, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not getting that damn key.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.20,0:07:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear on all that's holy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.96,0:07:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Leone Abbacchio, will\Nnever give up this key.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.56,0:07:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Mirror Man focuses on dragging\Nfools like you into the Netherrealm,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.90,0:07:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,it doesn't have much in the way of brute\Nforce, but I'm well aware of its strengths.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.42,0:07:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,For instance,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,in a compromising position such as this,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,it doesn't need the power of a superhuman\Nto finish off the likes of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.76,0:07:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.67,0:07:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,a four-year-old could slide this shard\Ndown your gullet without breaking a sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.06,0:08:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, sweet victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.92,0:08:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for showing me\Nexactly where to find s—huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.20,0:08:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.94,0:08:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.46,0:08:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself, Abakio.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.36,0:08:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think you can hide it from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.72,0:08:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you can move your body, you\Nwon't be able to escape me, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.56,0:08:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see right through\Nyou. Got that? Hide what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.78,0:08:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not making the least bit of sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Your bad acting isn't fooling anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.48,0:08:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, show me your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.68,0:08:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you doing this,\Nyou freaking bastardo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.60,0:08:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What, did you lose something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.28,0:08:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why so quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.90,0:08:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked a question. Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:08:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would he do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.52,0:08:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.44,0:09:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If this fool really chopped off his hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,then the stand's hand that's\Noutside the mirror is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.80,0:09:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.76,0:09:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The hand's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.52,0:09:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,His area.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.92,0:09:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it has the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's going back. Damn it, the key\Nis getting away and that new recruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.76,0:09:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno is just around the\Ncorner he cut off his own hand
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.60,0:09:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,just to give him the key\Nshould have killed me with that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.74,0:09:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,piece of glass back when you\Nhad a chance had you just done
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.56,0:09:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,that my stand's hand would have\Ndropped dead in its tracks?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.54,0:09:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Close but no cigar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.32,0:09:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad this is the sound of\Nyour dreams disintegrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.94,0:09:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pick up that key any second now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Shape-shifting bastardo did you really\Nthink i'd let that brat Giorno off the hook?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.16,0:09:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just drag his ass\Nin here too, so Giorno
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.62,0:10:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,do you finally get what\Nit's all about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as one of us gets\Nback with the key we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the one who does is\Na piece of shit like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.40,0:10:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing that matters is\Nsuccessfully carrying out the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.36,0:10:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow your thoughts are so loud I\Ncan practically hear them Abakio?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you actually believe you know\Nwhat's going on outside the mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If nothing else at least you have a loyal
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.20,0:10:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,partner it's a shame he's\Nnot the brightest bulb.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.18,0:10:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's throwing away all your hard work. But
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.12,0:10:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,don't take my word for\Nit look for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.20,0:10:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The fool's not even attempting to\Nflee with the key seems he's decided
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.44,0:10:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,To stay put, I suppose the but the\Nstress of the mission got to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.10,0:10:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.01,0:10:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.93,0:10:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Move your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.92,0:10:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the key!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.28,0:10:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of there now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.56,0:11:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can scream until\Nyou're even more purple.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.20,0:11:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll never hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.68,0:11:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I now have two options at my disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I could secure the key, then finish\Noff Giorno while basking in my victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.86,0:11:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Or I could lacerate his\Ntrachea and major arteries,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,watch him bleed out, then\Ncollect the key at my leisure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.22,0:11:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.58,0:11:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's the perfect day for\Nslicing open this pug's throat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.68,0:11:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he noticed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.72,0:11:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll let him in,\Nbut only his physical self.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.54,0:11:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my world!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.48,0:11:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Slice away, Mirror Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.04,0:11:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, that's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the virus!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.42,0:11:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that Giorno to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He got himself infected\Nby Fugo's purple smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.98,0:11:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The key stays with me, asshat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.92,0:11:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And mark my words, before I'm done,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.96,0:12:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring back Fugo and\NAbbacchio safe and south!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.66,0:12:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that Giorno Giovanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.06,0:12:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an arrogant, ignorant prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.80,0:12:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Purple smoke will turn him into\Nhuman fertilizer before he knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.90,0:12:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget part of me\Ndied on that horrible day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.60,0:12:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It left me completely numb.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.44,0:12:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The thought of losing a limb\Ndoesn't scare me in the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.64,0:12:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing that brings\Nme solace now is carrying
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.44,0:12:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,out the orders of an\Nomnipotent and powerful leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.16,0:12:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Devoting myself to this mission has\Ngiven my miserable life new purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.88,0:12:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Put simply, my orders were to\Nretrieve the key and protect the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.46,0:12:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Completing the mission\Nmeant everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet Giorno,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.16,0:12:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the Chiricolione,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.98,0:13:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,instead of getting the key back safely,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.64,0:13:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,he decided to risk the whole\Nplan to save me and Fugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.08,0:13:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid brat, how dare you bring\Nthat filthy disease in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.22,0:13:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.22,0:13:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You Goldilocks goon, you infected me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.18,0:13:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you have the same nasty symptoms I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.10,0:13:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It takes about 30 seconds for Purple\NSmoke's virus to infect the entire body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.48,0:13:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life is over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.40,0:13:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The writing was already\Non the wall when you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.54,0:13:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,decided to pull me into your mirror world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The mirror that Purple\NSmoke smashed to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.58,0:13:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno fixed some shards when\Nthe enemy chased after Abbacchio.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.84,0:13:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He took some shards with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.28,0:13:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno must have realized that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.66,0:13:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how he figured out\Nthe enemy's abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.76,0:13:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He infected himself with the virus,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,then allowed himself to be\Ndragged into the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.28,0:13:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There was no other way to take\Ndown a killer this cunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:13:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you to hell, Stronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.78,0:14:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.69,0:14:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't celebrate just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.58,0:14:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't been beaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.10,0:14:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to steal myself\Nfor the end of this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.04,0:14:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, mere man, allow me\Nto leave this hellhole.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.58,0:14:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Me and only me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.20,0:14:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,However, keep that damn virus contained!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.14,0:14:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No part of my body contaminated\Nwith the virus, so leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.48,0:14:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Merda, he's going to isolate the\Nvirus inside the mirror world with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.58,0:14:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If that cocky kagagatso can cut off\Nhis own damn hand to get the key,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.66,0:14:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,then you can bet your ass that\NI'm willing to do the same thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.82,0:14:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the glorious pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.46,0:14:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, grab him before he gets away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.64,0:14:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.90,0:14:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, he slipped through our fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.10,0:15:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You risked your life to\Ncome in here, and for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.44,0:15:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's gone, so's the mirror world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.32,0:15:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost got me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But the joke's on you, assholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.36,0:15:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The key to success is mental fortitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.98,0:15:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is simply a setback.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.18,0:15:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a hunch he'd leave his mirror world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.80,0:15:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Though all hope isn't lost yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.92,0:15:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know it, but his\Nfate was sealed a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.84,0:15:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,By stepping outside his\Nlittle mirror dimension,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.42,0:15:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,he may have inadvertently\Nsaved my life. Fugo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that he's outside the mirror world,\NPurple Smoke will be able to follow him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.76,0:15:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.14,0:15:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.12,0:15:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I really wish I could, but I can't\Ntell where he is from inside here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.10,0:15:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no way to attack him! I'm useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.00,0:15:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly where he is. Earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.56,0:16:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Wind took the liberty of transforming\Nthat brick outside into a snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.98,0:16:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why it's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.76,0:16:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Snakes can detect infrared radiation\Nfrom warm bodies, human bodies included.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.86,0:16:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.34,0:16:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.25,0:16:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,After all that mental preparation to\Nchop off my own arm and leave my realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.60,0:16:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.02,0:16:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.16,0:16:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stop it, damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.22,0:16:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, one hit from the death\Nvirus capsule and I'm a goner!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.16,0:17:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like lady luck\Nhasn't abandoned me yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.88,0:17:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If mirror man can just catch his\Npunch for a fraction of a second,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.00,0:17:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I might have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.18,0:17:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to block it once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.96,0:17:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish him off now. Purple smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.84,0:17:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,End this. Mirror man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This invalid needs to die now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.80,0:17:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.71,0:17:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.98,0:17:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I stopped it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.40,0:17:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to take this back with me\Ninto my lethal looking glass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.24,0:17:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.62,0:17:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.32,0:17:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.74,0:17:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I blocked its punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.46,0:17:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't strike anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.90,0:17:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I was physically and mentally prepared\Nto plunge myself into the real world!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.62,0:18:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it. We broke out of the mirror\Nhouse from hell. We finished him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.24,0:18:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and took care of his stand in the\Nprocess giorno you've been infected
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.50,0:18:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,purple smoke is in your blood it's\Ncirculating throughout your whole body
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.10,0:18:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you've been infected, there's\Nnothing I can do. Yeah, I know that, but
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.06,0:18:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,everything worked out for the best\Ntrust me him leaving his house of
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.96,0:18:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,mirrors really turned the tide in our\Nfavor pulling my diseased body into
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.32,0:18:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the mirror was well the proverbial\Nnail in the coffin who would have
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.92,0:19:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,thought the guy's refusal to admit defeat\Nwould turn out to be my lucky break
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.18,0:19:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,fortunately he recalled\Nhis powers just before
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.88,0:19:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,i was about to die\Nbringing me face to face
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.74,0:19:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,With this friendly snake\Nthat snakes the cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.56,0:19:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,of purple smoke's virus\Ndoesn't phase it at all
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.74,0:19:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,that's right i created this\Nsnake from a brick immersed
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.52,0:19:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,in purple smoke's viral vapor\Nthe virus was a part of his
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.00,0:19:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,natural habitat so he came\Ninto the world disease-free
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.24,0:19:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,do you get what i'm saying now\Namigo yes that's brilliant it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.84,0:19:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,was born with an immunity\Nsince it has natural defenses
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.14,0:19:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If we harvest its blood and\Ncells, we can make an antivirus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.20,0:19:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and stop the disease let's get\Nto work golden wind extract
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.40,0:19:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the antiviral serum from this\Nsnake and Injected to my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.82,0:20:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno Giovanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,When I first met him, I\Nthought he was just an oddball.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.08,0:20:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,with his head in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.56,0:20:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But he comes up with the\Nmost harebrained ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.46,0:20:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And somehow actually manages.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.02,0:20:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,to find a way to pull them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.84,0:20:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something about him that I trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.06,0:20:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He has an authenticity\Nyou can't put into words.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.62,0:20:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You sprang into action,\Njust like Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.40,0:20:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, you went above\Nand beyond to save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.28,0:20:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my eternal respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.80,0:20:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Fugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.84,0:20:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I did my part, but I'm not\Nthe one who missed his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.04,0:20:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I simply made a prediction\Nand acted accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.18,0:20:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who truly risked\Nhis life was Abbacchio.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.38,0:20:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He sustained serious injuries back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.86,0:20:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.02,0:20:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He risked everything for that key.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.64,0:21:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If he hadn't successfully delivered\Nthe key, we wouldn't be here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.48,0:21:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We would have been demolished.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.18,0:21:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.16,0:21:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs urgent help. Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.56,0:21:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.47,0:21:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.54,0:21:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.40,0:21:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I was going to beat the\Never-living shit out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.12,0:21:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But with my hand like\Nthis, I guess I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, I guess your\Nass-kicking will have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.18,0:21:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, the team got their key.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.52,0:21:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I close my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.56,0:21:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up feeling so horny!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.58,0:21:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get you out of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.68,0:21:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you'll be all I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.16,0:21:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I would give anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.22,0:22:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to make you understand me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.30,0:22:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.62,0:22:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Freaky, you're all I need!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.20,0:22:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.12,0:22:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.02,0:22:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, you got my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.04,0:22:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give it to you, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.52,0:22:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, you won't be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.38,0:22:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.04,0:22:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,you got my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.58,0:22:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If you've got my mind, all\NI want to do is free to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.80,0:22:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.48,0:22:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.92,0:22:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.60,0:22:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.54,0:22:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,To show how much I'm going to free to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.76,0:22:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.58,0:22:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.36,0:23:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,To show how much I'm going to free to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.58,0:23:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna break it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.14,0:24:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
